Pass the opened include stream to Flex's buffer constructor. Current
Flex-generated scanners disable buffer refills when the stream is NULL,
so Wine's custom YY_INPUT never reads the header.

--- a/tools/wrc/ppl.l
+++ b/tools/wrc/ppl.l
@@ -1486 +1486 @@
-	ppy__switch_to_buffer(ppy__create_buffer(NULL, YY_BUF_SIZE));
+	ppy__switch_to_buffer(ppy__create_buffer(fp, YY_BUF_SIZE));
